  "title": "Custom Inspirational Scripture Butterflies Blanket, Machine Washable",
  "handle": "custom-inspirational-scripture-butterflies-blanket-machine-washable",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace warmth and spiritual comfort with our personalized Christian blanket, designed by Jeminise. This inspirational blanket features uplifting Bible verses, offering a serene blend of faith and coziness, perfect for quiet reflection or as a cherished gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name or date to create a unique keepsake, making it a truly heartfelt and meaningful item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Adorned with Bible verses and Christian motifs, it provides daily encouragement and a sense of peace.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Skin-Friendly Fabric:</strong> Crafted from a blend of polyester and cotton, offering a gentle and cozy feel for ultimate comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from a range of sizes including 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> An ideal present for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms, perfect for moms, grandmas, and daughters who cherish their faith.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, and can be air dried without heat for quick and convenient cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>30x40, 50x60, 60x80 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
